<title>USA: ProMedCo says intends to buy Health Plans.</title>
<headline>ProMedCo says intends to buy Health Plans.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProMedCo Management Co said Tuesday it has signed a binding letter of intent to buy Maine-based Health Plans Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition of Health Plans, headquartered in Portland, will expand operations to two new states. Privately owned Health Plans provides capitation management services through risk-contracting with third-party payors.</p>
<p>ProMedCo is a physician practice management company, it said.</p>
